    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide animals to save baby penguins and escape with walruses. Change the rules with simple items like a hammer, a spring, or a magnet. Discover  emergent uses of these tools, and how they interact with other mechanics. Explore an open world of nested puzzles by gaining new capabilities and knowledge.<br><br>Puzzles are designed to showcase with a &quot;simple, but difficult&quot; philosophy, with each puzzle bringing a new idea. They're carefully designed to be instructive, tight, and deducible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/3ad32fc72b55af310b9c9150a663fec8.poster.avif?t=1752082784\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/3ad32fc72b55af310b9c9150a663fec8.webm?t=1752082784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/3ad32fc72b55af310b9c9150a663fec8.mp4?t=1752082784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Penguins, walruses, and fish! Each introduces opposing win criteria.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rapidly expanding set of mechanics and interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 diverse, hand-crafted levels. No filler!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An interconnected network of puzzles with item-based progression and metagame twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Journal for tracking mechanics, which also lists entries needed for the current puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A tiered hint system that teaches a deduction-based approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 biomes distinguishing areas and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/6793075716b24e6526385b5c03f3a65c.poster.avif?t=1752082784\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/6793075716b24e6526385b5c03f3a65c.webm?t=1752082784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/6793075716b24e6526385b5c03f3a65c.mp4?t=1752082784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No time-sensitive inputs, with undo and redo binds that work through resets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a controller, keyboard, or mouse with customizable binds. (Note: Puzzle editor requires a mouse.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Colorblind friendly with customizable colors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most puzzles are optional for progression, and a setting makes any puzzle skippable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warp navigation system for quickly returning to anywhere you've been.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your old solutions and [redacted]  and [redacted]  are saved, so you don't have to repeat work to accomplish any meta goals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/bc7b957030f0860ff3956b8eb83b5702.poster.avif?t=1752082784\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/bc7b957030f0860ff3956b8eb83b5702.webm?t=1752082784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/bc7b957030f0860ff3956b8eb83b5702.mp4?t=1752082784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Join the discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our small community and say hi! I love bouncing ideas off of players and answering questions.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slide animals to save baby penguins and escape with walruses. Change the rules with simple items like a hammer, a spring, or a magnet. Discover  emergent uses of these tools, and how they interact with other mechanics. Explore an open world of nested puzzles by gaining new capabilities and knowledge.<br><br>Puzzles are designed to showcase with a &quot;simple, but difficult&quot; philosophy, with each puzzle bringing a new idea. They're carefully designed to be instructive, tight, and deducible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/3ad32fc72b55af310b9c9150a663fec8.poster.avif?t=1752082784\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/3ad32fc72b55af310b9c9150a663fec8.webm?t=1752082784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/3ad32fc72b55af310b9c9150a663fec8.mp4?t=1752082784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Penguins, walruses, and fish! Each introduces opposing win criteria.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rapidly expanding set of mechanics and interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 diverse, hand-crafted levels. No filler!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An interconnected network of puzzles with item-based progression and metagame twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Journal for tracking mechanics, which also lists entries needed for the current puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A tiered hint system that teaches a deduction-based approach.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 biomes distinguishing areas and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Original music.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/6793075716b24e6526385b5c03f3a65c.poster.avif?t=1752082784\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/6793075716b24e6526385b5c03f3a65c.webm?t=1752082784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/6793075716b24e6526385b5c03f3a65c.mp4?t=1752082784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No time-sensitive inputs, with undo and redo binds that work through resets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a controller, keyboard, or mouse with customizable binds. (Note: Puzzle editor requires a mouse.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Colorblind friendly with customizable colors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most puzzles are optional for progression, and a setting makes any puzzle skippable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warp navigation system for quickly returning to anywhere you've been.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your old solutions and [redacted]  and [redacted]  are saved, so you don't have to repeat work to accomplish any meta goals.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/bc7b957030f0860ff3956b8eb83b5702.poster.avif?t=1752082784\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/bc7b957030f0860ff3956b8eb83b5702.webm?t=1752082784\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830480/extras/bc7b957030f0860ff3956b8eb83b5702.mp4?t=1752082784\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Join the discord</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our small community and say hi! I love bouncing ideas off of players and answering questions.</p>",
    "short_description": "A puzzler about sliding penguins and walruses. Pick up items to push, pull, bounce, swap, stop, steal, or explode. Uncover surprising twists hidden in a world of puzzles inside puzzles inside puzzles.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cEvery mechanic is taught to you through very clever but approachable puzzles, and then you\u2019re dropped into the meta madness where your ingenuity and understanding of the game are put to their limits. [...] Gentoo Rescue is a gem. And I truly mean it, I can\u2019t even find a single little flaw.\u201d<br>Thinky Games<br>",
